              "audioEnd": 134.713
            },
            {
              "text": "They understood that every person and animal played a key role in the task.",
              "audioStart": 135.575,
              "audioEnd": 139.425
            },
            {
              "text": "Without the help of the wife, the young girl, the dog, the cat, and the mouse, nothing would have changed.",
