              "audioEnd": 290.273
            },
            {
              "text": "And so the quiet village remained a place where friendship and teamwork mattered most.",
              "audioStart": 291.135,
              "audioEnd": 295.198
            },
            {
              "text": "The old man lived to a very old age, always remembering the day of the giant plant.",
